# Fixpt's commands, each written as an entry's line.
0 ,help\r
100 ,type (+ 1 2)\r
200 ,time (+ 1 2)\r
300 ,apropos string-app\r
400 ,help string-append\r
500 ,step-limit 5000\r
600 (define forever (subr (maxeff spin (read @globals)) (int) int) (lambda (n) (forever (+ n 1))))\r
700 (forever 0)\r
800 ,step-limit none\r
900 (forever 0)\r
1000 ,pending\r
1100 ,cancel 4\r
1200 ,bogus\r
1300 ,load tests/repl/load-me.fx\r
1400 (+ %4 1)\r
1500 ,quit\r
